<title>DENMARK: Danish FLS wins $17 million Chinese order.</title>
<headline>Danish FLS wins $17 million Chinese order.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish engineering and cement group FLS Industries said on Wednesday it won a $17 million order to provide machinery and equipment for China's Huaxin Cement Corporation.</p>
<p>It said the order would increase cement production at Huaxin's factory in Hubei province, near the city of Wuhan, by 4,000 tonnes per day to 7,800 tonnes per day with completion date set for summer 1998.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
